-    *   **Least-Squares (SS)**:
-        Solve a regularized least-squares problem [S1, unofficial]:
-        $$ \min_{\mathbf{x}} \|\mathbf{S}\mathbf{x} - \mathbf{y}\|_2^2 + \lambda \|\mathbf{x}\|_2^2 $$
